  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: el-Mushennef SYR</p>\r\n<p class=\" \">Mushennef is the site of a Roman prostyle temple that was built during the early Roman occupation of Syria and then rebuilt in the late second century. The cult is dedicated to a local manifestation of Zeus.</p>",
